  "topic": "cadagent_f1_wishbone",
  "title": "F1-inspired three-pickup wishbone with integral bearing bosses",
  "intent": "Build a lightened triangulated suspension study, join three separated boss profiles into one existing solid, drill three stepped bearing seats from a common datum, then revise four dependent dimensions without leaving a membrane in the aperture.",
